<title>USA: Guyana seeks 6,300 tonnes U.S. wheat - agent.</title>
<headline>Guyana seeks 6,300 tonnes U.S. wheat - agent.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guyana is tendering on Thursday for 2,300 tonnes of spring wheat, 1,000 tonnes of soft red winter and 3,000 tonnes of hard red winter under the PL-480 program, agents for the buyer said.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for July 4-26.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
